{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A decade has passed since the foreign god\u2019s appearance, filling the world with madness and plunging the world into a never-ending winter night. Humanity has fought back but is still on its last legs against anomalous humanoid creatures with logic-defying powers. One of these fighters, Weiss, loses their partner in a recent attack and has to fight to get them back against all odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Weiss Herber (they/them), a Scavenging leader for one of the last strongholds of humanity as they fight against the hordes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >in this demo you'll find...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >around an hour of reading time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a queer romance between the main character and their male partner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the introduction to a story of prevailing against the odds</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008890?t=1758856019","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008890?t=1758856019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008890/e7e65a30699532535fb8ace4f81b9f0470c4b5c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758856019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008890/e7e65a30699532535fb8ace4f81b9f0470c4b5c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758856019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A decade has passed since the foreign god\u2019s appearance, filling the world with madness and plunging the world into a never-ending winter night. Humanity has fought back but is still on its last legs against anomalous humanoid creatures with logic-defying powers. One of these fighters, Weiss, loses their par